art-2 sm:ml-[2px] sm:min-w-0 sm:p-[2px]"><div class="sm:min-h-full sm:bg-pure-black"><!--[-1--><!--[--><div class="relative isolate flex flex-col items-center justify-center overflow-x-hidden px-3"><div class="absolute top-0 left-0 -z-20 max-h-[640px] w-full overflow-hidden"><img src="/images/heroBg.webp" alt="Background pixel art cave illustration" style="image-rendering: pixelated;" class="w-full"/> <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full bg-gradient-to-t from-pure-black to-pure-black/0 h-40 sm:h-64"></div></div> <div class="absolute top-10 hidden w-full max-w-5xl flex-row items-center justify-end gap-8 sm:flex 2xl:max-w-7xl"><!--[-1--><!--]--> <!--[-1--><!--]--> <!--[-1--><!--]--> <a href="https://discord.gg/vs4MFrzncH" class="flex flex-row justify-center items-center gap-2"><img src="/icons/discordIcon.svg" alt="Discord icon" height="20" width="20"/> <span>Join</span></a></div><!----> <section class="mt-36 flex w-full max-w-5xl flex-col items-start gap-6 sm:mt-28 sm:gap-8 2xl:mt-40"><nav aria-label="Pixel art VFX navigation" class="flex items-center gap-1 font-chevyray text-sm"><a href="/" class="shrink-0 transition-opacity hover:opacity-75"><img src="/images/blog-icon-16.png" srcset="/images/blog-icon-32.png 2x" alt="Sprite Fusion" width="16" height="16" class="block h-4 w-4" style="image-rendering: pixelated"/></a> <span aria-hidden="true">/</span> <a href="/pixel-art-vfx" class="hover:text-white">pixel-art-vfx</a> <span aria-hidden="true">/</span></nav> <h1 class="font-chevyrayOeuf text-4xl sm:text-5xl">Explosion Pixel Art VFX</h1></section> <section class="mt-6 grid w-full max-w-5xl grid-cols-1 gap-[6px] bg-black p-[6px] shadow-window-body xl:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1fr)_360px]"><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-[6px]"><div class="bg-pure-black shadow-input"><!----><img src="/images/pixel-art-vfx/explosion-dirt.webp" alt="Explosion pixel art effect: Blast" width="320" height="200" style="image-rendering: pixelated;" class="aspect-[16/10] w-full object-cover"/><!----></div> <!--[-1--><!--]--></div> <div class="flex flex-col gap-[6px]"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4 px-1 pb-3 pt-2"><p>A blast out of the ground: a white-hot flash, a fireball cooling into smoke, earth and chunks thrown in arcs, dust rolling out, a shockwave and a scorch left behind. Size it from a grenade to a bomb.</p></div> <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 bg-pure-black px-2 py-[6px] shadow-input"><div class="grid grid-cols-[auto_minmax(0,1fr)] items-baseline gap-x-4 gap-y-2 pt-1"><!--[--><p class="text-sm text-light-gray">Category</p> <!--[0--><a href="/pixel-art-vfx?category=Combat" class="w-fit underline hover:text-white">Combat</a><!--]--><p class="text-sm text-light-gray">Dependencies</p> <!--[-1--><p>None</p><!--]--><p class="text-sm text-light-gray">License</p> <!--[-1--><p>MIT, free for commercial use</p><!--]--><!--]--></div></div> <div class="mt-auto flex w-full flex-col gap-2 p-1 sm:flex-row xl:flex-col"><!--[-1--><button class="font-chevyrayOeuf  relative overflow-hidden px-2 py-[6px] bg-medium-gray hover:bg-light-gray flex flex-row justify-center items-center focus:outline-none svelte-103j0yv shadow-button w-full opacity-100"><span class="pointer-events-none absolute bottom-[3px] left-[3px] top-[3px] z-0 bg-medium-gray" style="width: 0%; transition-duration: 160ms; transition-property: width; transition-timing-function: linear;"></span> <span class="relative z-10 flex flex-row items-center justify-center space-x-[6px]"><p>Connect your AI agent</p><!----></span></button><!--]--><!---->  <dialog aria-label="Connect your AI agent" class="m-auto max-h-[calc(100dvh-24px)] w-[calc(100%-24px)] max-w-xl overflow-y-auto border-0 bg-transparent p-0 text-white backdrop:bg-pure-black backdrop:opacity-90"><div class="shadow-window-body bg-black font-chevyray flex flex-col justify-center items-center min-h-0 w-full "><div class="flex flex-row justify-between w-full items-center py-[6px] px-2 shadow-window-head bg-medium-gray"><!--[-1--><p>Connect your AI agent</p><!--]--> <!--[0--><button><img src="/icons/closeIcon.svg" alt="Close icon" width="20" height="20"/></button><!--]--></div> <div class="p-[6px] flex min-h-0 grow flex-col justify-center items-center w-full"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-6 p-2 text-left sm:p-4"><p>Your AI agent reads all 25 effects, builds them into your game, and creates new ones from them.</p> <!--[--><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><h3>Claude Code</h3> <!--[--><div class="flex flex-row items-stretch gap-2"><!----><code class="flex min-w-0 grow items-center bg-pure-black px-2 py-[6px] text-sm shadow-input overflow-x-auto whitespace-nowrap font-mono [scrollbar-width:none] [&amp;::-webkit-scrollbar]:hidden">claude mcp add --transport http spritefusion https://www.spritefusion.com/mcp<!----></code><!----> <!--[-1--><button class="shrink-0 relative overflow-hidden px-2 py-[6px] bg-medium-gray hover:bg-light-gray flex flex-row justify-center items-center focus:outline-none svelte-103j0yv shadow-button opacity-100"><span class="pointer-events-none absolute bottom-[3px] left-[3px] top-[3px] z-0 bg-medium-gray" style="width: 0%; transition-duration: 160ms; transition-property: width; transition-timing-function: linear;"></span> <span class="relative z-10 flex flex-row items-center justify-center space-x-[6px]"><img src="/icons/duplicateIcon.svg" alt="" height="20" width="20"/> <p aria-live="polite">Copy</p><!----></span></button><!--]--><!----></div><!--]--></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><h3>Codex</h3> <!--[--><div class="flex flex-row items-stretch gap-2"><!----><code class="flex min-w-0 grow items-center bg-pure-black px-2 py-[6px] text-sm shadow-input overflow-x-auto whitespace-nowrap font-mono [scrollbar-width:none] [&amp;::-webkit-scrollbar]:hidden">codex mcp add spritefusion --url https://www.spritefusion.com/mcp<!----></code><!----> <!--[-1--><button class="shrink-0 relative overflow-hidden px-2 py-[6px] bg-medium-gray hover:bg-light-gray flex flex-row justify-center items-center focus:outline-none svelte-103j0yv shadow-button opacity-100"><span class="pointer-events-none absolute bottom-[3px] left-[3px] top-[3px] z-0 bg-medium-gray" style="width: 0%; transition-duration: 160ms; transition-property: width; transition-timing-function: linear;"></span> <span class="relative z-10 flex flex-row items-center justify-center space-x-[6px]"><img src="/icons/duplicateIcon.svg" alt="" height="20" width="20"/> <p aria-live="polite">Copy</p><!----></span></button><!--]--><!----></div><div class="flex flex-row items-stretch gap-2"><!----><code class="flex min-w-0 grow items-center bg-pure-black px-2 py-[6px] text-sm shadow-input overflow-x-auto whitespace-nowrap font-mono [scrollbar-width:none] [&amp;::-webkit-scrollbar]:hidden">codex mcp login spritefusion<!----></code><!----> <!--[-1--><button class="shrink-0 relative overflow-hidden px-2 py-[6px] bg-medium-gray hover:bg-light-gray flex flex-row justify-center items-center focus:outline-none svelte-103j0yv shadow-button opacity-100"><span class="pointer-events-none absolute bottom-[3px] left-[3px] top-[3px] z-0 bg-medium-gray" style="width: 0%; transition-duration: 160ms; transition-property: width; transition-timing-function: linear;"></span> <span class="relative z-10 flex flex-row items-center justify-center space-x-[6px]"><img src="/icons/duplicateIcon.svg" alt="" height="20" width="20"/> <p aria-live="polite">Copy</p><!----></span></button><!--]--><!----></div><!--]--></div><!--]--> <div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><h3>Then ask</h3> <div class="flex flex-row items-stretch gap-2"><!----><p class="flex min-w-0 grow items-center bg-pure-black px-2 py-[6px] text-sm shadow-input ">Use Sprite Fusion's explosion effect for my grenades: blow up where they land, with dirt in my ground's colour.<!----></p><!----> <!--[-1--><button class="shrink-0 relative overflow-hidden px-2 py-[6px] bg-medium-gray hover:bg-light-gray flex flex-row justify-center items-center focus:outline-none svelte-103j0yv shad