idth:none] [&amp;::-webkit-scrollbar]:hidden">codex mcp add spritefusion --url https://www.spritefusion.com/mcp<!----></code><!----> <!--[-1--><button class="shrink-0 relative overflow-hidden px-2 py-[6px] bg-medium-gray hover:bg-light-gray flex flex-row justify-center items-center focus:outline-none svelte-103j0yv shadow-button opacity-100"><span class="pointer-events-none absolute bottom-[3px] left-[3px] top-[3px] z-0 bg-medium-gray" style="width: 0%; transition-duration: 160ms; transition-property: width; transition-timing-function: linear;"></span> <span class="relative z-10 flex flex-row items-center justify-center space-x-[6px]"><img src="/icons/duplicateIcon.svg" alt="" height="20" width="20"/> <p aria-live="polite">Copy</p><!----></span></button><!--]--><!----></div><div class="flex flex-row items-stretch gap-2"><!----><code class="flex min-w-0 grow items-center bg-pure-black px-2 py-[6px] text-sm shadow-input overflow-x-auto whitespace-nowrap font-mono [scrollbar-width:none] [&amp;::-webkit-scrollbar]:hidden">codex mcp login spritefusion<!----></code><!----> <!--[-1--><button class="shrink-0 relative overflow-hidden px-2 py-[6px] bg-medium-gray hover:bg-light-gray flex flex-row justify-center items-center focus:outline-none svelte-103j0yv shadow-button opacity-100"><span class="pointer-events-none absolute bottom-[3px] left-[3px] top-[3px] z-0 bg-medium-gray" style="width: 0%; transition-duration: 160ms; transition-property: width; transition-timing-function: linear;"></span> <span class="relative z-10 flex flex-row items-center justify-center space-x-[6px]"><img src="/icons/duplicateIcon.svg" alt="" height="20" width="20"/> <p aria-live="polite">Copy</p><!----></span></button><!--]--><!----></div><!--]--></div><!--]--> <div class="flex flex-col gap-2"><h3>Then ask</h3> <div class="flex flex-row items-stretch gap-2"><!----><p class="flex min-w-0 grow items-center bg-pure-black px-2 py-[6px] text-sm shadow-input ">Use Sprite Fusion's explosion effect for my grenades: blow up where they land, with dirt in my ground's colour.<!----></p><!----> <!--[-1--><button class="shrink-0 relative overflow-hidden px-2 py-[6px] bg-medium-gray hover:bg-light-gray flex flex-row justify-center items-center focus:outline-none svelte-103j0yv shadow-button opacity-100"><span class="pointer-events-none absolute bottom-[3px] left-[3px] top-[3px] z-0 bg-medium-gray" style="width: 0%; transition-duration: 160ms; transition-property: width; transition-timing-function: linear;"></span> <span class="relative z-10 flex flex-row items-center justify-center space-x-[6px]"><img src="/icons/duplicateIcon.svg" alt="" height="20" width="20"/> <p aria-live="polite">Copy</p><!----></span></button><!--]--><!----></div><!----></div> <p class="text-sm">Claude, Cursor, VS Code, ChatGPT or another agent? <a href="/docs/pixel-art-generator/api/mcp" class="underline hover:text-white">See the MCP docs</a>.</p></div><!----></div></div><!----></dialog><!----></div></div> <div class="flex flex-col gap-4"><h3 class="border-b-2 border-medium-gray pb-2">In your code</h3> <pre class="overflow-x-auto bg-pure-black p-3 font-mono text-sm leading-relaxed shadow-input"><code>import explosion from "./explosion";

const frame = { w: 320, h: 180, ox: 0, oy: 0, color: new Uint32Array(320 * 180), light: new Uint32Array(320 * 180) };
const fx = explosion({ x: 320, y: 300 });

fx.update(1 / 60);
frame.color.fill(0);
frame.light.fill(0);
fx.draw(frame, "back");
fx.draw(frame, "front");
if (fx.done()) remove(fx);</code></pre></div></section> <section class="mt-24 flex w-full max-w-5xl flex-col gap-8 sm:mt-32"><h2 class="font-chevyrayOeuf text-3xl sm:text-4xl">More pixel art VFX</h2> <div class="grid w-full grid-cols-1 gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"><!--[--><a href="/pixel-art-vfx/impact" class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-3 bg-black p-2 shadow-button"><img src="/images/pixel-art-vfx/impact-hits-and-ricochets.webp" alt="Impact pixel art effect, animated" width="320" height="200" loading="lazy" style="image-rendering: pixelated;" class="aspect-[16/10] w-full bg-pure-black object-cover shadow-input"/> <div class="flex grow flex-col gap-2 px-1 pb-1"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><p class="font-chevyrayOeuf text-lg">Impact</p> <!--[-1--><!--]--></div> <p class="text-sm">Bullet hits and ricochets: sparks, shards, chips and dust.</p></div></a><a href="/pixel-art-vfx/slash" class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-3 bg-black p-2 shadow-button"><img src="/images/pixel-art-vfx/slash-slash.webp" alt="Slash pixel art effect, animated" width="320" height="200" loading="lazy" style="image-rendering: pixelated;" class="aspect-[16/10] w-full bg-pure-black object-cover shadow-input"/> <div class="flex grow flex-col gap-2 px-1 pb-1"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><p class="font-chevyrayOeuf text-lg">Slash</p> <!--[0--><span class="bg-pure-black px-2 py-px text-xs text-orange-500 shadow-input">New</span><!--]--></div> <p class="text-sm">A blade's cut drawn as light, from white-hot edge to fading tail.</p></div></a><a href="/pixel-art-vfx/muzzle-flash" class="flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-3 bg-black p-2 shadow-button"><img src="/images/pixel-art-vfx/muzzle-flash-smg-burst.webp" alt="Muzzle Flash pixel art effect, animated" width="320" height="200" loading="lazy" style="image-rendering: pixelated;" class="aspect-[16/10] w-full bg-pure-black object-cover shadow-input"/> <div class="flex grow flex-col gap-2 px-1 pb-1"><div class="flex